      "comment": "NANO BUBBLES (8) was prominent at the corner and finished third last time over 975m at Swan Hill when resuming from a spell, beaten 4 lengths. Likely improver with strong prospects. FOUR ON THE FLOOR (2) finished behind NANO BUBBLES last start, giving away a big start. Previous effort was good enough to win this. REGAL TIME (9) is a 7YO mare who didn't do much in her first 16 starts but has placed at her past two and strikes the right type of race to go on with things. PIERRE LE QUILL (5) missed the placings two runs back then got a long way back last start when 4.5 lengths away in seventh over 1400m at Pakenham Synthetic. Well placed and there is no reason he cannot find winning ways. ROUGHNUT (6) is a 10-start maiden who could only manage to finish seventh at his latest appearance over 1620m at Donald. Cannot be ruled out in this suitable assignment.",
